  data: {
    LLM: "1. Two Sub-Rounds: Each player plays one card face-up (Round 1), and then everyone plays a second card (Round 2) to complete the 'Double Trick'.\n2. Trump Priority: The highest trump card played in the double trick wins all cards. If no trumps are played, the highest card of the led suit wins.\n3. Following Suit: There is NO requirement to follow suit. You may play a trump or any other suit at any time.",
    Player: "1. Two Sub-Rounds: Each player plays one card face-up (Round 1), and then everyone plays a second card (Round 2) to complete the 'Double Trick'.\n2. Trump Priority: The highest trump card played in the double trick wins all cards. If no trumps are played, the highest card of the led suit wins.\n3. Following Suit: There is NO requirement to follow suit. You may play a trump or any other suit at any time.",
